(18, 'Data', 'Toni', '<div><br></div><div><span data-huuid=\\\"16320578035947026668\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 29, 53); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">Data engineering is&nbsp;<mark class=\\\"QVRyCf\\\" style=\\\"background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(211, 227, 253); border-radius: 4px; padding: 0px 2px;\\\">a specialized field of software engineering focused on designing, building, and maintaining data systems and infrastructure</mark>.&nbsp;</span><span data-huuid=\\\"16320578035947026433\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 29, 53); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">It involves collecting raw data from various sources, processing and transforming it into a usable format, and storing it in an organized and efficient way.&nbsp;</span><span data-huuid=\\\"16320578035947026198\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 29, 53); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">The primary goal of data engineering is to provide reliable, high-quality data for data analysts,&nbsp;</span></div><pre>&lt;?php\\r\\n$host = \\\"localhost\\\";\\r\\n$user = \\\"root\\\";\\r\\n$pass = \\\"\\\";\\r\\n$dbname = \\\"blog\\\";\\r\\n\\r\\n$conn = new mysqli($host, $user, $pass, $dbname);\\r\\nif ($conn-&gt;connect_error) {\\r\\n    die(\\\"Connection failed: \\\" . $conn-&gt;connect_error);\\r\\n}\\r\\n?&gt;\\r\\n</pre><img src=\\\"blob:http://localhost/d6c1b33a-0dd9-4933-a91c-a67d80657723\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%;\\\"><audio src=\\\"blob:http://localhost/7a29e8e8-65e0-4617-86a8-5c5eb174df1d\\\" controls=\\\"\\\"></audio><video src=\\\"blob:http://localhost/eb58e399-be5c-42a6-b2fe-f89fa7e2fac3\\\" controls=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"300\\\"></video>', 'uploads/image/1757607742_img.avif', '', 'uploads/audio/1757607742_aud.mp3', 'uploads/video/17576