(23, 'Cyber', 'Toni', '<span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 29, 53); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">Java is a high-level, object-oriented programming language and platform that was originally developed by Sun Microsystems and released in 1995. It is now owned by Oracle.</span><span jscontroller=\\\"JHnpme\\\" class=\\\"pjBG2e\\\" data-cid=\\\"b23767e3-d895-41db-8245-918541450375\\\" jsaction=\\\"rcuQ6b:npT2md\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 29, 53); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span class=\\\"UV3uM\\\" style=\\\"text-wrap-mode: nowrap;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 29, 53); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">Java is a high-level, object-oriented programming language and platform that was originally developed by Sun Microsystems and released in 1995. It is now owned by Oracle.</span><span jscontroller=\\\"JHnpme\\\" class=\\\"pjBG2e\\\" data-cid=\\\"b23767e3-d895-41db-8245-918541450375\\\" jsaction=\\\"rcuQ6b:npT2md\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 29, 53); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span class=\\\"UV3uM\\\" style=\\\"text-wrap-mode: nowrap;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span><pre>&lt;?php\\r\\n$host = \\\"localhost\\\";\\r\\n$user = \\\"root\\\";\\r\\n$pass = \\\"\\\";\\r\\n$dbname = \\\"blog\\\";\\r\\n\\r\\n$conn = new mysqli($host, $user, $pass, $dbname);\\r\\nif ($conn-&gt;connect_error) {\\r\\n    die(\\\"Connection failed: \\\" . $conn-&gt;connect_error);\\r\\n}\\r\\n?&gt;\\r\\n</pre><img src=\\\"blob:http://localhost/c0d259a7-7f3b-4415-a4c9-e62be5076a2d\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%;\\\"><audio src=\\\"blob:http://localhost/a6cd83cf-5c74-448a-8f0c-3bcd412b809a\\\" controls=\\\"\\\"></audio><video src=\\\"blob:http://localhost