(24, 'Back-End', 'virat', '<ul jscontroller=\\\"M2ABbc\\\" jsaction=\\\"jZtoLb:SaHfyb\\\" data-hveid=\\\"CCcQAQ\\\" data-ved=\\\"2ahUKEwjCo-SDo9GPAxUl4TgGHSkzDNkQm_YKegQIJxAB\\\" style=\\\"margin: 10px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22px; padding-inline-start: 24px; color: rgb(0, 29, 53); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><li class=\\\"K3KsMc\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; list-style-position: inherit; list-style-image: inherit; list-style-type: none;\\\"><div class=\\\"zMgcWd dSKvsb\\\" data-il=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; border-bottom: none; margin-inline-start: -28px;\\\"><div data-crb-p=\\\"\\\"><div class=\\\"xFTqob\\\" style=\\\"flex: 1 1 0%; min-width: 0px;\\\"><div class=\\\"Gur8Ad\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 22px; overflow: hidden; padding-bottom: 4px; transition: transform 200ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1);\\\"><span data-huuid=\\\"10562949997980003948\\\"><strong>Object-Oriented:</strong></span></div><div class=\\\"vM0jzc\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(84, 93, 126); letter-spacing: 0.1px; line-height: 22px;\\\"><span data-huuid=\\\"10562949997980001227\\\">Java is built around the concept of objects and classes, meaning everything in Java is associated with classes and objects, along with their attributes and methods.&nbsp;</span><span data-huuid=\\\"10562949997980002602\\\">This paradigm promotes modularity, reusability, and maintainability of code.</span></div></div></div></div></li><li class=\\\"K3KsMc\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; list-style-position: inherit; list-style-image: inherit; list-style-type: none;\\\"><div class=\\\"zMgcWd dSKvsb\\\" data-il=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 8px; border-bottom: none; margin-inline-start: -28px;\\\"><div data-crb-p=\\\"\\\"><div class=\\\"xFTqob\\\" style=\\\"flex: 1 1 0%; min-width: 0px;\\\"><div class=\\\"Gur8Ad\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 22px; overflow: hidden; padding-bottom: 4px; transition: transform 200ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1);\\\"><span data-huuid=\\\"10562949997980001256\\\"><strong>Platform-Independent (Write Once, Run Anywhere - WORA):</strong></span></div><div class=\\\"vM0jzc\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(84, 93, 126); letter-spacing: 0.1px; line-height: 22px;\\\"><span data-huuid=\\\"10562949997980002631\\\">Java code is compiled into an intermediate format called bytecode.&nbsp;</span><span data-huuid=\\\"10562949997980004006\\\">This bytecode can then be executed on any device that has a Java Virtual Machine (JVM) installed, regardless of the underlying operating system or hardware architecture.</span></div></div></div></div></li></ul><pre>&lt;br /&gt;\\r\\n&lt;b&gt;Warning&lt;/b&gt;:  include(db.php): Failed to open stream: No such file or directory in &lt;b&gt;D:\\\\XAMPP21\\\\htdocs\\\\your_project\\\\uploads\\\\code\\\\signup.php&lt;/b&gt; on line &lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\\r\\n&lt;br /&gt;\\r\\n&lt;b&gt;Warning&lt;/b&gt;:  include(): Failed opening \\\'db.php\\\' for inclusion (include_path=\\\'D:\\\\XAMPP21\\\\php\\\\PEAR\\\') in &lt;b&gt;D:\\\\XAMPP21\\\\htdocs\\\\your_project\\\\uploads\\\\code\\\\signup.php&lt;/b&gt; on line &lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\\r\\n\\r\\n&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\\r\\n&lt;html lang=\\\"en\\\"&gt;\\r\\n&lt;head&gt;\\r\\n  &lt;meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" /&gt;\\r\\n  &lt;meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\"/&gt;\\r\\n  &lt;title&gt;Signup&lt;/title&gt;\\r\\n  &lt;link rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"signup.css\\\" /&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/head&gt;\\r\\n&lt;body&gt;\\r\\n  &lt;div class=\\\"signup-container\\\"&gt;\\r\\n    &lt;h2&gt;Signup&lt;/h2&gt;\\r\\n    &lt;form method=\\\"post\\\" action=\\\"\\\"&gt;\\r\\n      &lt;input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Email\\\" required /&gt;\\r\\n      &lt;input type=\\\"text\\\" name=\\\"roll_no\\\" placeholder=\\\"Roll Number\\\" required /&gt;\\r\\n      &lt;select name=\\\"role\\\" required&gt;\\r\\n        &lt;option value=\\\"\\\"&gt;Select&lt;/option&gt;\\r\\n        &lt;option value=\\\"student\\\"&gt;Student&lt;/option&gt;\\r\\n        &lt;option value=\\\"faculty\\\"&gt;Faculty&lt;/option&gt;\\r\\n      &lt;/select&gt;\\r\\n      &lt;input type=\\\"password\\\" name=\\\"password\\\" placeholder=\\\"Create your password\\\" required /&gt;\\r\\n      &lt;input type=\\\"password\\\" name=\\\"confirm\\\" placeholder=\\\"Confirm your password\\\" required /&gt;\\r\\n      &lt;button type=\\\"submit\\\"&gt;Signup&lt;/button&gt;\\r\\n    &lt;/form&gt;\\r\\n    &lt;p class=\\\"login-link\\\"&gt;Already have an account? &lt;a href=\\\"login.php\\\"&gt;Login&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n\\r\\n      &lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/body&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/html&gt;\\r\\n</pre><img src=\\\"blob:http://localhost/a61e01d6-838a-4379-b322-81b4e74b73c1\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%;\\\"><audio src=\\\"blob:http://localhost/608e245d-0f0d-403a-9946-60a672facd0b\\\" controls=\\\"\\\"></audio><video src=\\\"blob:http://localhost/ea7ee15f-6cec-4cfa-9811-c046e43bace8\\\" controls=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"300\\\"></video>', 'uploads/images/1757613422_img.avif', '', 'uploads/audio/1757613422_aud.mp3', 'uploads/video/1757613422_vid.mp4', '2025-09-11 17:57:02');

