(1, 'AI-Automation', 'virat', '<span data-huuid=\\\"7532614653733862799\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 29, 53); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">Data analytics is&nbsp;<mark class=\\\"QVRyCf\\\" style=\\\"background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(211, 227, 253); border-radius: 4px; padding: 0px 2px;\\\">the process of examining raw data to extract meaningful insights, make conclusions, and drive informed decision-making through the collection, transformation, and organization of data</mark>.&nbsp;</span><span data-huuid=\\\"7532614653733860214\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 29, 53); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">It involves using tools and techniques, from statistical analysis to machine learning and AI, to uncover trends, patterns, and correlations in large datasets.&nbsp;</span><pre>&lt;?php\\r\\n$host = \\\"localhost\\\";\\r\\n$user = \\\"root\\\";\\r\\n$pass = \\\"\\\";\\r\\n$dbname = \\\"blog\\\";\\r\\n\\r\\n$conn = new mysqli($host, $user, $pass, $dbname);\\r\\nif ($conn-&gt;connect_error) {\\r\\n    die(\\\"Connection failed: \\\" . $conn-&gt;connect_error);\\r\\n}\\r\\n?&gt;\\r\\n</pre><img src=\\\"blob:http://localhost/969e6a87-f4b7-4bf4-a691-66f59366597b\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%;\\\">', 'uploads/image/1757520385_img.jpeg', '', '', '', '2025-09-10 16:06:25'),
