(8, 'Data Science', 'Toni', '<span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 29, 53); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">Data science is&nbsp;<mark class=\\\"QVRyCf\\\" style=\\\"background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(211, 227, 253); border-radius: 4px; padding: 0px 2px;\\\">an interdisciplinary field that extracts meaningful insights from large, complex datasets by combining principles from statistics, mathematics, computer science, and domain expertise to solve problems and drive decision-making</mark>.</span><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 29, 53); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 29, 53); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">Data science is&nbsp;<mark class=\\\"QVRyCf\\\" style=\\\"background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(211, 227, 253); border-radius: 4px; padding: 0px 2px;\\\">an interdisciplinary field that extracts meaningful insights from large, complex datasets by combining principles from statistics, mathematics, computer science, and domain expertise to solve problems and drive decision-making</mark>.</span><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 29, 53); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">&nbsp;</span><pre>&lt;?php\\r\\n$host = \\\"localhost\\\";\\r\\n$user = \\\"root\\\";\\r\\n$pass = \\\"\\\";\\r\\n$dbname = \\\"blog\\\";\\r\\n\\r\\n$conn = new mysqli($host, $user, $pass, $dbname);\\r\\nif ($conn-&gt;connect_error) {\\r\\n    die(\\\"Connection failed: \\\" . $conn-&gt;connect_error);\\r\\n}\\r\\n?&gt;\\r\\n</pre><img src=\\\"blob:http://localhost/2acb0b68-d31c-48cd-9d5b-593cf49a4548\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%;\\\"><audio src=\\\"blob:http://localhost/d001c385-5dd1-43d2-b1de-3d6b29191bf6\\\" controls=\\\"\\\"></audio><video src=\\\"blob:http://localhost/f98a42bd-f719-413e-8ef9-be2b3317168c\\\" controls=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"300\\\"></video>', 'uploads/images/1757590229_img.jpg', '', 'uploads/audio/1757590229_aud.mp3', 'uploads/video/1757590229_vid.mp4', '2025-09-11 11:30:29'),
(9, 'Data Engineering', 'Toni', '<span data-huuid=\\\"16320578035947026668\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 29, 53); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">Data engineering is&nbsp;<mark class=\\\"QVRyCf\\\" style=\\\"background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(211, 227, 253); border-radius: 4px; padding: 0px 2px;\\\">a specialized field of software engineering focused on designing, building, and maintaining data systems and infrastructure</mark>.&nbsp;</span><span data-huuid=\\\"16320578035947026433\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 29, 53); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">It involves collecting raw data from various sources, processing and transforming it into a usable format, and storing it in an organized and efficient way.&nbsp;</span><span data-huuid=\\\"16320578035947026668\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 29, 53); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">Data engineering is&nbsp;<mark class=\\\"QVRyCf\\\" style=\\\"background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(211, 227, 253); border-radius: 4px; padding: 0px 2px;\\\">a specialized field of software engineering focused on designing, building, and maintaining data systems and infrastructure</mark>.&nbsp;</span><span data-huuid=\\\"16320578035947026433\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 29, 53); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">It involves collecting raw data from various sources, processing and transforming it into a usable format, and storing it in an organized and efficient way.&nbsp;</span><pre>&lt;?php\\r\\n$host = \\\"localhost\\\";\\r\\n$user = \\\"root\\\";\\r\\n$pass = \\\"\\\";\\r\\n$dbname = \\\"blog\\\";\\r\\n\\r\\n$conn = new mysqli($host, $user, $pass, $dbname);\\r\\nif ($conn-&gt;connect_error) {\\r\\n    die(\\\"Connection failed: \\\" . $conn-&gt;connect_error);\\r\\n}\\r\\n?&gt;\\r\\n</pre><img src=\\\"blob:http://localhost/32f9a88d-a847-4374-ad6a-983b6dcfcc28\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%;\\\"><audio src=\\\"blob:http://localhost/0f8f519d-6c6f-4d23-a6b9-fbd487eb69d0\\\" controls=\\\"\\\"></audio><video src=\\\"blob:http://localhost/f6f7e762-36bd-4e3b-bc22-f04159009784\\\" controls=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"300\\\"></video>', 'uploads/images/1757603144_img.jpg', '', 'uploads/audio/1757603144_aud.mp3', 'uploads/video/1757603144_vid.mp4', '2025-09-11 15:05:44'),
(10, 'Java', 'Toni', '<ul jscontroller=\\\"M2ABbc\\\" jsaction=\\\"jZtoLb:SaHfyb\\\" data-hveid=\\\"CCcQAQ\\\" data-ved=\\\"2ahUKEwjCo-SDo9GPAxUl4TgGHSkzDNkQm_YKegQIJxAB\\\" style=\\\"margin: 10px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22px; padding-inline-start: 24px; color: rgb(0, 29, 53); font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><li class=\\\"K3KsMc\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; list-style-position: inherit; list-style-image: inherit; list-style-type: none;\\\"><div class=\\\"zMgcWd dSKvsb\\\" data-il=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; border-bottom: none; margin-inline-start: -28px;\\\"><div data-crb-p=\\\"\\\"><div class=\\\"xFTqob\\\" style=\\\"flex: 1 1 0%; min-width: 0px;\\\"><div class=\\\"Gur8Ad\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 22px; overflow: hidden; padding-bottom: 4px; transition: transform 200ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1);\\\"><span data-huuid=\\\"10562949997980003948\\\"><strong>Object-Oriented:</strong></span></div><div class=\\\"vM0jzc\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(84, 93, 126); letter-spacing: 0.1px; line-height: 22px;\\\"><span data-huuid=\\\"10562949997980001227\\\">Java is built around the concept of objects and classes, meaning everything in Java is associated with classes and objects, along with their attributes and methods.&nbsp;</span><span data-huuid=\\\"10562949997980002602\\\">This paradigm promotes modularity, reusability, and maintainability of code.</span></div></div></div></div></li><li class=\\\"K3KsMc\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; list-style-position: inherit; list-style-image: inherit; list-style-type: none;\\\"><div class=\\\"zMgcWd dSKvsb\\\" data-il=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 8px; border-bottom: none; margin-inline-start: -28px;\\\"><div data-crb-p=\\\"\\\"><div class=\\\"xFTqob\\\" style=\\\"flex: 1 1 0%; min-width: 0px;\\\"><div class=\\\"Gur8Ad\\\" style=\